From cc92c93a72673020da4a498011dd5b6d552b4185 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 07:26:45 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add Null layer UI and fix Null parent offset in preview

- Null tool button creates a NullLayer and opens it in the keyframe toolbar
- NullHandleView: draggable crosshair on the preview. Drag places the Null
  (no keyframes yet) or auto-keyframes at the playhead; one undo step per drag
- Null track in the timeline (purple), keyframe cue row, easing graph support
- Keyframe property menu: "Parent (Null)" for text/image layers, "Delete Null"
  for Nulls (children are un-parented on delete)
- Fix preview: NullLayer was never passed to TextOverlayView and
  ImageOverlayView.allOperations was never set, so parentOffsetAt() always
  returned 0 in preview while export was correct
- ProjectSerializer: deserialize NullLayer (previously dropped on reload)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PEa9uJMG1DSsVRyCaERiyr
